    <span class="tag">fns.usda.gov</span>
  </div>
  <div class="impact"><span class="impact-label">What this means for you</span>If you or someone you know is on SNAP, this is the most direct and immediate hit on this entire dashboard — millions have already lost benefits while food prices keep climbing. Check eligibility rules directly if your status may have changed.</div>
</section>

