    <span class="tag">bls.gov</span>
  </div>
  <div class="impact"><span class="impact-label">What this means for you</span>This won't hit your wallet directly, but it's an early warning system. If PPI keeps falling, expect consumer inflation (the number that does hit your wallet) to keep cooling too, with a one-to-two month lag.</div>
</section>

